        "nvidia-smi -q ECC counters over time",
        "XID 92 timestamps for rate calculation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "runbook_id": "xid-48-dbe",
      "title": "XID 48 — Double-bit ECC error (uncorrectable)",
      "severity": "critical",
      "score": 9,
      "first_steps": [
        "Drain the node so no new work lands on the affected GPU.",
        "Keep the GPU idle and record the event with GPU serial, slot, and node for the service record.",
        "Check whether the same GPU reported XID 92 (single-bit ECC storm) in the preceding days — that is the classic precursor pattern."
      ],
      "cautions": [
        "Do not simply reboot and return the node to the pool — uncorrectable errors tend to recur.",
        "A single XID 48 is drain-and-watch; recurrence, not the first event, is the RMA trigger in this runbook."
      ],
      "evidence_to_collect": [
        "dmesg Xid lines",
        "nvidia-smi -q ECC counters",
        "prior XID 92 history for the same GPU"
      ]
    },
